{"unit_id":"yiliang114__dsh-session-deck#caveat-1","repo":"yiliang114/dsh-session-deck","commit":"701c86b3eeb2c0f07aa59205fea49c0cee9b44fb","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Deck 会在浏览器 localStorage 保存视图、会话未读状态和提醒记录；这些是会话 ID 与状态元数据，不含对话正文，清除站点存储会重置它们。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:690","lib/client.js:8"]}
